{"1704840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PsyUp: A Psychological Physics Puzzle", "steam_appid": 1704840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER THE MIND. ORGANIZE THOUGHTS. RELAX.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704840/extras/c173c2c0f0d10e4c1889faa5d7353e24.avif?t=1780958351\" width=780 height=208 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PsyUp is a minimalist physics puzzle with a psychological atmosphere — where every block you break feels like taking a weight off your mind.<br><br>No drama. No complicated explanations.  <br>Just that good feeling of reorganizing inner chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BREAKING BLOCKS HAS NEVER FELT THIS GOOD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704840/extras/c002e77df4fb7b2b1215dd17c7af2cb4.poster.avif?t=1780958351\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704840/extras/c002e77df4fb7b2b1215dd17c7af2cb4.webm?t=1780958351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704840/extras/c002e77df4fb7b2b1215dd17c7af2cb4.mp4?t=1780958351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tap. Destroy. Release. Reorganize.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><i>Every move dismantles inner tension, as if you were tidying up your own thoughts  </i><br><i>— a simple yet powerful ritual.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to play. Deep to feel.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant feedback</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That irresistible “just one more” feeling</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><i>Challenge physics, calm your mind, and feel the pleasure of bringing order to chaos… one block at a time.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A JOURNEY THROUGH THE HUMAN MIND</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704840/extras/ece4a880652f6216f10b741e9cbad802.avif?t=1780958351\" width=776 height=238 /></span><strong>Levels inspired by psychological phenomena</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world has its own <strong>“personality”</strong>:  <br>fast like anxiety, chaotic like ADHD, rigid like perfectionism.<br><br><strong>Explore real human sensations, translated into physics-based puzzles.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MADE TO RELAX</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704840/extras/b85f135c6a9ace7e47258ac8fa96ea19.poster.avif?t=1780958351\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704840/extras/b85f135c6a9ace7e47258ac8fa96ea19.webm?t=1780958351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704840/extras/b85f135c6a9ace7e47258ac8fa96ea19.mp4?t=1780958351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soft sounds, a calm rhythm, and clean visuals</strong> create a space where the mind can slow down.<br><br>PsyUp was designed as that short pause in the middle of the day —  <br><strong>a quick, satisfying emotional breather</strong>.<br><br>Nothing clutters the screen. Nothing rushes you.  <br><strong>Just you, the blocks, and the calm that emerges as everything falls into place.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHY PLAY?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704840/extras/58319ab3ca95ce191d862bbb195f4e7f.avif?t=1780958351\" width=780 height=208 /></span><br><strong>★ Immersive psychological atmosphere</strong>  <br><i>— each world carries its own emotional tone.</i><br><br><strong>★ Simple and addictive physics puzzles</strong>  <br>— tap, break, discover patterns, and find your flow.<br><br><strong>★ Memorable thematic worlds</strong>  <br>— every level explores a facet of the human mind.<br><br><strong>★ A genuine sense of stress relief</strong>  <br>— breaking blocks has never been this satisfying.<br><br><strong>★ Audio and visuals designed for relaxation</strong>  <br>— soft, clean, and deeply pleasant to play.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER THE MIND. ORGANIZE THOUGHTS. RELAX.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704840/extras/c173c2c0f0d10e4c1889faa5d7353e24.avif?t=1780958351\" width=780 height=208 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PsyUp is a minimalist physics puzzle with a psychological atmosphere — where every block you break feels like taking a weight off your mind.<br><br>No drama. No complicated explanations.  <br>Just that good feeling of reorganizing inner chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BREAKING BLOCKS HAS NEVER FELT THIS GOOD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mu